  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Scoring multiple Kills with the weapon spawns a Dawning Gift for you and allies. Dawning Gifts remain on the ground for 10 seconds.\n\nPicking up Dawning Gifts grants 10% Grenade, Melee, and Class Ability Energy, restores 22 HP, and starts Health Regeneration.\n\nActivation progress on Kills by <link Enemy Rank [#CombatantClassifications] />:\n• Minors and Guardians: 16.66%\n• Elites, Minibosses, and Bosses: 50%\n\n#ChunkEnergyScalars",
      "updatedAt": "2024-12-17T12:37:19.288Z",
      "updatedBy": "Stardust"
    }
  },
